  "rulesText": "Sometimes friends are as good as territory. You may treat up to three **+3 faction statuses** you hold as if they are **turf**.",
  "commentary": "If your status changes, you lose the turf until it becomes +3 again. Regardless of how much turf you hold (from this ability or otherwise) the minimum **rep** cost to advance your Tier is always 6.",
